usage: validate.py [-h] --window {Y,J} --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR

Fresh Y/J refits with frozen recipes and pre-origin blend weights. Validation
rents are held separately and replaced by zeros in every fitting bundle. No
early stopping, new weight fitting or model selection is performed. Outputs
belong to a new run; original development evidence is never overwritten.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --window {Y,J}
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
